@zmb3 PTAL
Added details to address concerns about slow consumers blocking the Job by the previous approach, which was looping through the subscriber channels to send new messages.
My initial suggestion to mitigate that was to have the channels be buffered, but, we could run into the same problem if the buffer gets full, with this approach, the Job will not be blocked by slow consumers.

